---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Meet Dr. Sanju Lall — Clinic Profile Demo"
  description="A demonstration doctor profile layout using publicly listed professional information about Dr. Sanju Lall."
>
  <main class="profile-page">
    <header class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Your Clinic home"><span class="brand-mark">+</span><span>YOUR CLINIC</span></a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="/">← Back to home</a>
    </header>

    <section class="profile-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> MEET THE DOCTOR · SAMPLE PROFILE</p>
        <h1>Expertise,<br /><em>with empathy.</em></h1>
        <p class="intro">A profile built around the person behind the practice — their training, clinical focus, and approach to care.</p>
        <div class="doctor-name">
          <h2>Dr. Sanju Lall</h2>
          <p>Dentist · Prosthodontics &amp; Implantology</p>
          <p class="credentials">BDS · MDS · FPFA (USA) · MFDI · MIDA</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portrait-wrap">
        <div class="portrait-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <img class="portrait" src="https://drupal-cdn-hfaeddcdbng5hfbg.a01.azurefd.net/sites/default/files/2026-03/dr-sanju-lall.jpg" alt="Portrait of Dr. Sanju Lall, sourced from her Apollo Hospitals public profile" />
        <p class="portrait-caption">Portrait source: Apollo Hospitals public profile</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-foot"><span>01 / THE DOCTOR</span><span>NEW DELHI, INDIA · DEMO CONTENT</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="facts">
      <div><span class="fact-label">CLINICAL EXPERIENCE</span><strong>30+ years</strong><small>As listed by Apollo Hospitals</small></div>
      <div><span class="fact-label">PRIMARY FOCUS</span><strong>Restorative care</strong><small>Prosthodontics and implantology</small></div>
      <div><span class="fact-label">LANGUAGES</span><strong>English · Hindi</strong><small>Nepali / Nepalese also listed</small></div>
    </section>

    <section class="story section">
      <div class="section-tag">02 / BACKGROUND</div>
      <div class="story-grid">
        <h2>Care shaped by<br /><em>experience.</em></h2>
        <div>
          <p class="large-copy">Professor Dr. Sanju Lall is a dentist whose published profile highlights prosthodontics, implantology, and full-mouth rehabilitation.</p>
          <p>Apollo Hospitals lists her as a Professor and Senior Consultant in its dental services in New Delhi. Her professional background also includes teaching undergraduate and postgraduate students, examining postgraduate students in India and Nepal, and earlier clinical and academic roles in India and Nepal.</p>
          <p>This page is a design reference only. Dr. Lall is not being represented as a member of “Your Clinic.”</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="credentials-section section">
      <div class="section-tag">03 / EDUCATION &amp; EXPERIENCE</div>
      <h2>A career built<br /><em>over time.</em></h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article><span>QUALIFICATIONS</span><div><h3>BDS · MDS</h3><p>Her Apollo profile lists Bachelor of Dental Surgery and Master of Dental Surgery, along with FPFA (USA), MFDI, and MIDA.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>1997–1998</span><div><h3>Clinical practice in Nepal</h3><p>Listed roles include Consultant Prosthodontist at Apollo Hospitals, Kathmandu, and Nepal Oral Health Society, Kathmandu.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>2000–2009</span><div><h3>Academic appointments</h3><p>Her listed history includes senior lecturer, reader, and associate professor roles in dental education.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>2010–PRESENT</span><div><h3>Indraprastha Apollo Hospitals</h3><p>Her profile lists a Senior Consultant role from 2010 and a Professor role from 2023.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="expertise section">
      <div class="section-tag">04 / CLINICAL INTERESTS</div>
      <div class="expertise-grid">
        <h2>Specialist care,<br /><em>clearly explained.</em></h2>
        <div class="expertise-list">
          <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Prosthodontics</h3><p>Restoring oral function with crowns, bridges, and other prosthetic solutions.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Dental implants</h3><p>Single and multiple implant prostheses are named among her specialist interests.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Full-mouth rehabilitation</h3><p>A listed area of clinical interest in her published professional profile.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Teaching &amp; mentorship</h3><p>Her profile notes involvement in undergraduate and postgraduate teaching.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reviews section">
      <div class="section-tag">05 / PATIENT INFORMATION</div>
      <div class="reviews-grid">
        <div><h2>Trust begins<br /><em>with transparency.</em></h2><p>Rather than inventing testimonials or a star rating, this demo links directly to the source profile so visitors can check the information themselves.</p></div>
        <div class="review-panel">
          <p class="review-label">SOURCE-VERIFIED PROFILE</p>
          <h3>Read Dr. Lall’s full profile</h3>
          <p>View the hospital-published biography, experience, qualifications, and appointment information.</p>
          <a href="https://www.apollohospitals.com/doctors/dentist/delhi/dr-sanju-lall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Apollo profile ↗</a>
          <small>Patient reviews are not reproduced here because this source page does not provide a clearly attributable review set in the information used for this demo.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="source-note">
      <p>DEMO / RESEARCH NOTE</p>
      <p>Dr. Sanju Lall’s professional details and portrait are referenced from her public Apollo Hospitals profile. This concept is not affiliated with Apollo Hospitals or Dr. Lall and must not be published as a real clinic’s doctor page without permission and verification.</p>
      <a href="https://www.apollohospitals.com/doctors/dentist/delhi/dr-sanju-lall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View original source ↗</a>
    </section>
    <footer class="footer"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">+</span><span>YOUR CLINIC</span></a><span>DESIGN CONCEPT · PROFILE PAGE</span><a href="/">Home ↑</a></footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { background: #efeee9; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; color: #1e2c31; font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; }
  .profile-page { overflow: hidden; background: #efeee9; }
  .nav { height: 78px; padding: 0 clamp(22px, 6vw, 92px); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-bottom:1px solid #d8d6ce; }
  .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; text-decoration:none; font-size:10px; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:.2em; }
  .brand-mark { display:grid; place-items:center; width:30px; height:30px; border:1px solid #738080; border-radius:50%; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:400; }
  .nav-link { font-size:11px; text-decoration:none; color:#526367; }
  .profile-hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr; gap:6%; align-items:center; min-height:680px; padding:70px clamp(24px, 10.8vw, 164px) 100px; background:#e6e5de; }
  .hero-copy { position:relative; z-index:2; }
  .eyebrow,.section-tag { color:#7d817a; font-size:9px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.19em; }
  .eyebrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin:0 0 32px; }
  .eyebrow span { width:26px; height:1px; background:#9b8d73; }
  h1,h2,h3,p { margin-top:0; }
  h1,h2 { font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.065em; }
  h1 { margin-bottom:40px; font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,96px); line-height:.94; }
  h1 em,h2 em { color:#9a8b70; font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif; font-weight:400; }
  .doctor-name { border-top:1px solid #c9c8bf; padding-top:22px; }
  .doctor-name h2 { margin-bottom:8px; font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,38px); letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .doctor-name p { margin-bottom:8px; color:#566467; font-size:12px; }
  .doctor-name .credentials { color:#8b795b; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .portrait-wrap { position:relative; align-self:stretch; min-height:460px; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center; }
  .portrait-backdrop { position:absolute; right:0; bottom:0; width:86%; height:85%; background:#d2d4cd; border-radius:48% 48% 0 0; }
  .portrait { position:relative; z-index:1; display:block; width:100%; max-width:440px; height:100%; max-height:540px; object-fit:contain; object-position:center bottom; mix-blend-mode:multiply; filter:contrast(1.02); }
  .portrait-caption { position:absolute; right:0; bottom:-24px; color:#818680; font-size:9px; }
  .hero-foot { position:absolute; bottom:25px; left:clamp(24px, 10.8vw, 164px); right:clamp(24px, 10.8vw, 164px); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; color:#747d7a; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.15em; }
  .facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:0; padding:0 clamp(24px,10.8vw,164px); background:#203b43; color:#f4f1e8; }
  .facts > div { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px; padding:30px 22px 32px 0; }
  .facts > div + div { padding-left:24px; border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
  .fact-label { color:#c4b99f; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.15em; }
  .facts strong { font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:clamp(19px,2.3vw,28px); font-weight:400; }
  .facts small { color:rgba(244,241,232,.62); font-size:10px; }
  .section { padding:100px clamp(24px,10.8vw,164px); }
  .section-tag { margin-bottom:42px; }
  .story-grid,.expertise-grid,.reviews-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10%; align-items:start; }
  .section h2 { font-size:clamp(44px,5.8vw,72px); line-height:1.02; }
  .large-copy { color:#2a3d42; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:23px; line-height:1.5; }
  .story-grid p:not(.large-copy),.reviews-grid > div > p { color:#697476; font-size:12px; line-height:1.9; }
  .credentials-section { background:#e5e4dc; }
  .credentials-section > h2 { margin-bottom:55px; }
  .timeline { border-top:1px solid #cfcec5; }
  .timeline article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.35fr 1fr; gap:30px; padding:24px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #cfcec5; }
  .timeline article > span { padding-top:5px; color:#9a8b70; font-size:9px; letter-spacing:.13em; }
  .timeline h3,.expertise h3 { margin-bottom:7px; font-size:17px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .timeline p,.expertise p { max-width:570px; margin-bottom:0; color:#687477; font-size:12px; line-height:1.8; }
  .expertise { background:#efeee9; }
  .expertise-list article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr; gap:16px; padding:21px 0; border-top:1px solid #d3d1c8; }
  .expertise-list article > span { padding-top:3px; color:#9a8b70; font-size:9px; }
  .reviews { background:#203b43; color:#f6f4ed; }
  .reviews .section-tag { color:#cfc4ad; }
  .reviews h2 em { color:#d0c4ab; }
  .reviews-grid > div > p { color:rgba(246,244,237,.68); }
  .review-panel { padding:30px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); }
  .review-label { color:#d0c4ab!important; font-size:8px!important; letter-spacing:.15em; }
  .review-panel h3 { margin:26px 0 10px; font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:27px; font-weight:400; }
  .review-panel p:not(.review-label) { color:rgba(246,244,237,.68); font-size:12px; line-height:1.8; }
  .review-panel a { display:inline-flex; margin:12px 0 22px; padding:14px 17px; background:#e8e3d8; color:#263d43; font-size:11px; text-decoration:none; }
  .review-panel small { display:block; color:rgba(246,244,237,.48); font-size:10px; line-height:1.7; }
  .source-note { padding:32px clamp(24px,10.8vw,164px); background:#d9d8d0; }
  .source-note p:first-child { margin-bottom:12px; color:#8a7b5f; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.16em; }
  .source-note p:nth-child(2) { max-width:850px; color:#687477; font-size:11px; line-height:1.8; }
  .source-note a { font-size:10px; text-underline-offset:4px; }
  .footer { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:16px; padding:22px clamp(22px,6vw,92px); color:#647174; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.13em; }
  .footer .brand { color:#263b40; }
  .footer > a:last-child { text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0; }
  @media(max-width:700px) {
    .nav { height:68px; }
    .profile-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:25px; padding-top:54px; padding-bottom:80px; }
    h1 { font-size:clamp(56px,15vw,82px); margin-bottom:32px; }
    .portrait-wrap { min-height:360px; max-height:420px; grid-row:2; }
    .portrait { max-height:410px; }
    .hero-foot { font-size:7px; }
    .facts { grid-template-columns:1fr; padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px; }
    .facts > div,.facts > div + div { padding:19px 0; border-left:0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
    .facts > div:last-child { border-bottom:0; }
    .section { padding-top:72px; padding-bottom:76px; }
    .story-grid,.expertise-grid,.reviews-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:22px; }
    .section-tag { margin-bottom:32px; }
    .timeline article { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:10px; }
    .review-panel { padding:23px; }
    .footer { flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .footer > span { display:none; }
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { :global(html) { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
</style>
